Package: mote-chatd
Version: 2.0.0-8
Architecture: all
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: MoteBus Engineering <engineering@ypcloud.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/motebus/agent-sphere-deb
Depends: uchatd (>= 0.6.0-1)
Description: one-transaction bridge for retiring legacy mote-chatd ownership
 This package can only upgrade a reviewed mote-chatd 2.0.0-4, 2.0.0-6 or 2.0.0-7
 installation after native uchatd is installed. It contains no daemon and
 exists only so DPKG can retire the old package without deleting its locked
 legacy configuration file.
